    "created_at": "2015-09-23T23:13:27Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-09-23T23:13:27Z",
    "body": "Closing; this is a Blink bug, not a bug in the HTML spec.\n\nIf it turns out a majority of browsers follow Blink instead of the spec, then we should change the spec, but this issue only presents evidence for Blink and Gecko so far, and Blink is currently fixing its binding layer with respect to the global.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
